---
layout: base.njk
title: Nilasaar Coffee — Slow Grown, Never Rushed
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Shade Grown &middot; Eastern Ghats</p>
  <h1>One coffee.<br /><em>Slow grown.<br />Never rushed.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Grown in the same forests as our honey, at altitude, in the shade of the canopy &mdash; ripened slowly, roasted with care.</p>
  <div class="hero-divider"></div>
</section>

<section class="catalog catalog-light">
  <div class="container">
    {% if collections.coffeeProducts.length == 1 %}
      {% set product = collections.coffeeProducts[0] %}
      {% include "featured-product.njk" %}
    {% elif collections.coffeeProducts.length > 1 %}
      <div class="product-grid reveal">
        {% for product in collections.coffeeProducts %}
          {% include "product-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="catalog-empty">Our first batch is roasting &mdash; coffee arrives here soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
